  "text": "For Our Veterinary Colleagues - Heal Cancer Care for Pets\nSkip to content\n1642 W. Armory Way, Ste. 102 Seattle, WA\n206.888.4325\nRx\nNew Patients\nRx\nNew Patients\nAbout\nOur Approach\nMeet the Veterinary Team\nCareers\nCancer Care\nPet Parents\nVeterinary Colleagues\nPatient Stories\nContact\nAbout\nOur Approach\nMeet the Veterinary Team\nCareers\nCancer Care\nPet Parents\nVeterinary Colleagues\nPatient Stories\nContact\nVeterinary Colleagues\nCancer Care\nCollaboration\nat HEAL\nAt HEAL, we believe that interdisciplinary collaboration is the cornerstone of effective\ncancer care\nfor pets.\nAnd we walk the walk, building strong working relationships with the referring community to deliver the comprehensive, coordinated care each patient needs and deserves.\nonline referral form\nHow We Collaborate with\nReferring Veterinarians\nOur intention is to support primary care practices and your patients through thorough, responsive communication. We make sure you receive timely updates about every patient you refer to us and remain actively informed throughout their care journey.\nFor example, to simplify coordination and ensure seamless continuity of care, HEAL manages all follow-up blood work and mid-treatment monitoring in-house. This allows us to streamline communication and keep everything under one roof while keeping referring veterinarians informed every step of the way.\nWe’re also happy to complete diagnostic workups for patients without a confirmed cancer diagnosis, helping to ease caseloads and support our referring partners.\nTo Make a Referral or Schedule a Teleconsultation\nWe welcome your calls and are available to provide guidance for any case you feel would benefit from the expertise of our board-certified veterinary medical oncologist.\nTo refer a patient, simply call\n206-888-HEAL (4325)\nor submit an online referral form below. We will be in touch shortly to confirm a time or request relevant medical records.\nThank you for the opportunity to partner with you in the care of your patients.\nonline referral form\nContact Information\n1642 W. Armory Way, Ste. 102 Seattle, WA 98119\nFree on-site parking available\n206.888.HEAL (4325)\ninfo@healpetcancer.com\nSocial Media\nFacebook\nInstagram\nCopyright © 2026 HEAL Cancer Care for Pets. All Rights Reserved.  |\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nTerms & Conditions\nScroll Up\nAbout\nOur Approach\nMeet the Veterinary Team\nCareers\nCancer Care\nPet Parents\nVeterinary Colleagues\nPatient Stories\nContact\nRx\nNew Patients\n642 W. Armory Way, Ste. 102 Seattle, WA 98119\n206.888.HEAL (4325)\ninfo@healpetcancer.com\nFacebook\nInstagram\nSchedule Here",
